heonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-03T12:35:56-08:00","id":22511,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>horvagab</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/21487-hunter-mortal-remains-preview-the-faithful-of-shulpae?p=22403#post22403\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I understand, and I think it's a bad idea to force creativity... though if this book does well is there a chance to see conspiracies for those factions as a seperate PDF product down the line? Or some of the supplemental Conspiracies (Vascu, Cainite, etc...) getting a Compact &amp; Conspiracies treatment? I'd love t o see how VASCU deals with a few of the factions, Changeling and Geist foremost<br /> <br /> Also, how does this Endowment interact with Werewolf Dominions (I think?) and Witch Mysteries?</div> </div> </div> </div>Not out of the question that we could do more down the line as separate PDFs or something. Expanding on stuff from supplements though is really hard, and doesn't typically do very well (for obvious reasons, they can never perform as well as the original supplements, so that's a huge limitation). <br /> <br /> I would count them as Dread Powers at their dot ratings.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>David A Hill Jr </b><br /> Freelance Writer<br /> Independent Game Designer","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/70-machineiv","name":"MachineIV","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar70_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1791"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-03T12:55:08-08:00","id":22525,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LostLight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/21487-hunter-mortal-remains-preview-the-faithful-of-shulpae?p=22493#post22493\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> oh well.. At least I we have Dream Catchers!..<br /> <br /> So whose up for reviving Grave Robbers and Torch Bearers?</div> </div> </div> </div> I'm currently full up on projects where I'm the lead and Cults still has plenty of cool stuff to do <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> but I'd be more than happy to contribute. I'd wait until Mortal Remains are published so that you can shamelessly steal the sweet sweet ideas within. I might reopening Dream Catchers though, incorporate some of the ideas from Mortal Remains and some of the feedback it got. Flyboy would have to approve of course.<br /