17:05:42-08:00","id":31330,"title":"","content":"I'm now adding the whole thing about how their research and techniques (since they involve putting their agents in a deathlike state) have proven to have a relatively high risk of producing Bound. At first this was seen as a major breakthrough - but soon it became clear that rather than unlocking some new untapped human potential, their agents were infected with alien entities - often with homicidal tendencies. Once euthanasia proved a complete disaster, they now maintain a blacksite where they keep captured Bound (including former agents) in permanent cryogenic suspension. Modern agents are specifically conditioned to refuse the Bargain - but obviously desperate men will still make stupid decision for their survival.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-17T02:46:38-08:00","id":31563,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/21487-hunter-mortal-remains-preview-the-faithful-of-shulpae?p=31249#post31249\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arro